    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_3",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Andy Milder (born August 16, 1969) is an American actor and voice actor. He has appeared in such films as \"Apollo 13\", \"Armageddon\", \"Rumor Has It…\", \"Frost/Nixon\", \"Transformers\" and \"Domino\". He was a series regular on \"Fame L.A.\" and \"Weeds\", and appeared on such shows as \"\", \"\", \"The West Wing\", \"Six Feet Under\", \"Ugly Betty\", \"Boston Legal\", \"Parks and Recreation\", \"Married... with Children\", \"The Wonder Years\", \"Private Practice\" and \"Criminal Minds\". Milder provided narration for \"Ballroom Bootcamp\", \"101 Most Starlicious Make-Overs\", and \"Wrecks to Riches\". He provided the voice of Prince Sebastian LaCroix in the 2004 video game \"\" and Lightning Lad in the 2006 animated series \"Legion of Super Heroes\" and the film \"\". From 2005 to 2009, he was a recurring cast member and later series regular on \"Weeds\" as Dean Hodes. Starting in 2011, he is a recurring cast member on the Disney Channel sitcom \"Austin & Ally\" as Lester Dawson. He also had an appearance on the show \"Royal Pains\" on the USA Network.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.39939889403097595,
